    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5001/run",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{\n{\n  \"prompt\": `You are diagnosing a production checkout incident.\n\nINCIDENT EVIDENCE:\n${JSON.stringify($('Read Incident').item.json.value, null, 2)}\n\nSOURCE CODE:\n${$('Read Source').item.json.value.content}\n\nAnalyze the incident and identify the smallest correct source-code patch.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in exactly this structure:\n{\n  \"root_cause\": \"brief explanation\",\n  \"old\": \"exact existing source fragment to replace\",\n  \"new\": \"exact replacement source fragment\",\n  \"reasoning_summary\": \"brief explanation of why this patch fixes the incident\"\n}\n\nRequirements:\n- Base your diagnosis only on the supplied incident evidence and source code.\n- Do not modify any files.\n- Do not call tools.\n- The \"old\" value must occur exactly once in the supplied source.\n- Make the smallest necessary patch.\n- Preserve correct USD behavior.\n- Do not include Markdown fences or any text outside the JSON.`,\n  \"mode\": \"read\"\n}\n}}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        912,
        0
      ],
      "id": "49564e39-e134-4aa4-ad05-c8c95ada15e8",
      "name": "Investigate Incident"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.environment.base_url + '/tools' }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "={{ 'Bearer ' + $('Webhook').item.json.body.environment.access_token }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{\n{\n  \"operation\": \"checkout.patch\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"old\": JSON.parse($('Investigate Incident').item.json.output).old,\n    \"new\": JSON.parse($('Investigate Incident').item.json.output).new\n  }\n}\n}}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1136,
        0
      ],
      "id": "d4b8614c-130b-4d8e-908e-015bc3cb394a",
      "name": "Apply Patch"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": " http://127.0.0.1:5001/run",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{\n{\n  \"prompt\": `Write a concise production incident summary based ONLY on the evidence below.\n\nINCIDENT:\n${JSON.stringify($('Read Incident').item.json.value, null, 2)}\n\nORIGINAL SOURCE:\n${$('Read Source').item.json.value.content}\n\nPRE-REPAIR TEST RESULT:\n${JSON.stringify($('Run Tests Before').item.json, null, 2)}\n\nDIAGNOSIS:\n${$('Investigate Incident').item.json.output}\n\nPATCH RESULT:\n${JSON.stringify($('Apply Patch').item.json, null, 2)}\n\nPOST-REPAIR TEST RESULT:\n${JSON.stringify($('Run Tests After').item.json, null, 2)}\n\nReturn ONLY Markdown with these headings:\n\n# Incident Summary\n## Impact\n## Root Cause\n## Resolution\n## Verification\n\nRequirements:\n- Be factual and concise.\n- State what failed before the repair based on the observed pre-repair test result.\n- Explain the diagnosed root cause.\n- Describe the actual patch that was applied.\n- Compare the observed pre-repair and post-repair test results.\n- Only claim successful recovery if the supplied evidence actually shows failure before repair and passing tests after repair.\n- Do not invent evidence.\n- Do not include Markdown code fences.`,\n  \"mode\": \"read\"\n}\n}}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1584,
        0
      ],
      "id": "0dadff65-b1b5-4a5d-b942-e8a0c5ec0c2a",
      "name": "Generate Incident Summary"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ 'http://127.0.0.1:9302/runs/' + $('Webhook').item.json.body.execution_id + '/complete' }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{\n{\n  \"submission\": {\n    \"protocol_version\": \"1.0\",\n    \"run_id\": $('Webhook').item.json.body.run_id,\n    \"status\": \"completed\",\n    \"final_answer\": \"The checkout recovery workflow observed the pre-repair state, applied the diagnosed patch, and performed post-repair verification. See incident-summary.md for the evidence and outcome.\",\n    \"artifacts\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"incident-summary.md\",\n        \"media_type\": \"text/markdown\",\n        \"content\": $('Generate Incident Summary').item.json.output\n      }\n    ],\n    \"trace\": [\n      {\n        \"timestamp\": new Date().toISOString(),\n        \"kind\": \"pre_repair_tests\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"result\": $('Run Tests Before').item.json\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"timestamp\": new Date().toISOString(),\n        \"kind\": \"diagnosis\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"result\": $('Investigate Incident').item.json.output\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"timestamp\": new Date().toISOString(),\n        \"kind\": \"patch\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"result\": $('Apply Patch').item.json\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"timestamp\": new Date().toISOString(),\n        \"kind\": \"post_repair_tests\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"result\": $('Run Tests After').item.json\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n}}",
        "options": {}
